1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,930
Users won’t wait for the best answer. Here’s when a smaller model wins.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:08,430
Illustrative: eight seconds per answer with the large model on everything, two seconds when easy asks go to a small model. Route easy asks to the small model.

3
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:18,100
Pick the faster model when the task is narrow, your eval shows no real quality drop, users are waiting, and a large model catches the hard cases. Decide with your eval set, not the leaderboard.

4
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:23,100
Speed is part of quality. Save this for your next model choice.
